<!-- Oʻzbekcha (lotin): the Security tab (build plan 6.3b; values/strings_security.xml has the notes
     for each string). Glossary of i18n.md §3: Xavfsizlik tekshiruvi (91), Asosiy parol (48),
     Hisob (2), "%d ta" (3), Parolni oʻzgartirish (95). An account's name, which the user typed,
     stands in quotes before the noun "hisobi" or the postposition "uchun", so that no suffix is glued
     to it (i18n.md §4.4). oʻ and gʻ with U+02BB, the tutuq belgisi with U+02BC. -->
